          "book": "2SA",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 2
        }
      ],
      "en": "There was of Saul’s house a servant whose name was Ziba, and they called him to David; and the king said to him, “Are you Ziba?” He said, “I am your servant.”",
      "ko": "사울의 종 하나가 있으니 그 이름은 시바라 저를 다윗의 앞으로 부르매 왕이 저에게 묻되 네가 시바냐 가로되 종이 그로소이다",
      "source_text_hash": "c3ddb3931c6ebd7c8c7987686d818e215bad8f608116d20a1d923d267ad18188",
      "translation_text_hash": "a4c8c2fbdf5affd13a2e071131a6600399dd8e9c795384d1c68aa1d03820edfc",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
