      ],
      "en": "Mephibosheth had a young son, whose name was Mica. All who lived in Ziba’s house were servants to Mephibosheth.",
      "ko": "므비보셋에게 젊은 아들 하나가 있으니 이름은 미가더라 무릇 시바의 집에 거하는 자들은 므비보셋의 종이 되니라",
      "source_text_hash": "0ae3e3b3c42d55b65ad7c3901d715ece8f684b70c1fba84e449a7f3be10ec012",
      "translation_text_hash": "9f690cc32a8e691d592aac6e423487d47835985836696ab03d055aa40ad1a9c0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
